      "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@panaceapalm/video/7543294577936026902",
      "caption": "High Protein Creamy Cajun Chicken & Rice! 🔥🍗🤤 #mealprep #highprotein #creamycajunchicken  #tastymealprep #easymealprep        55g Protein! Delicious High Protein Meal Prep💪🏽 Checkout my High Protein Cookbook with 180+ recipes just like this one! (Link in bio)📕👨🏽‍🍳  Serves 4: 🍽️🍽️🍽️🍽️ Calories & Macros 📊 Per Meal: 547 calories  55g P | 55g C | 9g F Cajun seasoning (homemade) - 2 tsp smoked paprika - 2 tsp garlic powder - 1 tsp onion powder - 1 tsp ground black pepper - 1 tsp cayenne pepper (adjust for heat preference) - 1 tsp dried oregano - 2 tsp salt Cajun Chicken - 800g boneless skinless chicken breast (flattened) - 20g Cajun seasoning mix - Cooking spray Cajun Fried Rice  - 700g cooked cold white rice (roughly 230g dry, cook before hand and refrigerate) - 20g light butter (brand: lurpak) - 1/2 red onion (diced) - 2 cloves garlic (diced) - 2 tsp Cajun seasoning mix Creamy Cajun Sauce  - 200ml low fat or fat free milk - 150g light cream cheese - 20g Parmesan - 1 tsp cajun seasoning (Rest of Cajun seasoning) - 10g light butter Storage & Heating ♨️ - Store for up to 5 days in the fridge, I like to store the sauce seperate but this is optional - To reheat, add the contents to a microwave safe bowl and microwave covered with a damp paper towel for 3-4 minutes till heated through, mix well and enjoy! Need more inspiration🔥 Checkout my High Protein Cookbook with 180+ recipes just like this one! (Link in bio)📕👨🏽‍🍳 ",
